der)\\n\\n  [ac-2]\\n    Given: A component using design tokens\\n\\n    When: The dark theme tokens are applied\\n\\n    Then: oklch colors render correctly and status colors (pending=amber, in_progress=orange,\\npending_review=blue, needs_work=yellow, completed=emerald, blocked=red, cancelled=gray)\\nare visually distinct\\n\\n  [ac-3]\\n    Given: A view with loading states\\n\\n    When: Content is loading\\n\\n    Then: Shimmer animation plays on skeleton elements, gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\\n\\n  [ac-4]\\n    Given: An active agent task card\\n\\n    When: The agent is working\\n\\n    Then: Breathing/pulse animation plays on the card border, gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\\n\\n\\n─── Notes ───\\n[2026-03-05T01:30:03.199Z] @claude:\\nSee plan @plan-ui-ux-revamp for implementation notes\\n[2026-03-05T04:20:57.692Z] @claude:\\nExecution context:\\n- Background: Foundation design token layer that all other UI revamp tasks build on\\n- Scope: Create lib/ds/ directory with tokens.css and animations.css; extend app.css @theme inline block with design-* tokens, status colors, spacing, z-index, typography; add shimmer and breathing animations gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\\n- Files: packages/web-ui/src/lib/ds/tokens.css, packages/web-ui/src/lib/ds/animations.css, packages/web-ui/src/app.css, tests for AC coverage\\n- Verification: npm test in project root, vitest tests validating token presence and animation definitions\\n[2026-03-05T04:31:57.761Z] @claude:\\nImplementation complete. Created:\\n- lib/ds/tokens.css: 16 oklch color tokens, 4 radii, 7 spacing, 7 z-index, 3 fonts, 7 status colors (light+dark)\\n- lib/ds/animations.css: ds-shimmer (2s) and ds-breathe (3s) keyframes with prefers-reduced-motion gates\\n- Updated app.css: imports tokens/animations, extends @theme inline with all design-* token mappings\\n- tests/web-ui-design-system.test.ts: 18 tests covering all 4 ACs (reads built CSS output)\\n- Build succeeds, all 18 new tests pass, fu