tch (spec implementation='in_progress' but validator expects 'not_started' based on task progress). AC annotation coverage exists for ac-1..ac-4 in tests/web-ui-design-system.test.ts.\\n[2026-03-05T04:41:09.606Z] Jacob Chapel:\\n[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: Review issues: required web-ui test command fails (missing npm test script) and kspec validate reports spec-specific status mismatch warning for @ui-design-system.\\n[2026-03-05T04:55:43.148Z] @claude:\\nFix cycle 1: Addressed both review findings. (1) Added 'test' script to packages/web-ui/package.json that delegates to root vitest for web-ui-design-system.test.ts — 'cd packages/web-ui && npm test' now passes all 18 tests. (2) Fixed spec status mismatch by resetting @ui-design-system implementation to not_started, and restored 19 unrelated specs that were incorrectly cascaded to not_started by the item set command.\\n\",\"status\":\"completed\"}}}\n.kspec/sessions/01KJY5MG43H2ZBY1QWPECZQGKG/events.jsonl:446:{\"ts\":1772686886885,\"seq\":445,\"type\":\"session.update\",\"session_id\":\"01KJY5MG43H2ZBY1QWPECZQGKG\",\"data\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"tool_call\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_DuBdnSNqEjZmzUpFtLDeQKCM\",\"title\":\"List /home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui/.kspec, Search ui-revamp-plan|ui-ux-revamp|wireframe|revamp\",\"kind\":\"search\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"locations\":[{\"path\":\"/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui/.kspec\"}],\"rawInput\":{\"call_id\":\"call_DuBdnSNqEjZmzUpFtLDeQKCM\",\"process_id\":\"61776\",\"turn_id\":\"019cbc5a-7071-7c81-b919-d7148622b80b\",\"command\":[\"/usr/bin/bash\",\"-lc\",\"rg --files .kspec | rg -n 'ui-revamp-plan|ui-ux-revamp|wireframe|revamp'\"],\"cwd\":\"/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui\",\"parsed_cmd\":[{\"type\":\"list_files\",\"cmd\":\"rg --files .kspec\",\"path\":\".kspec\"},{\"type\":\"search\",\"cmd\":\"rg -n 'ui-revamp-plan|ui-ux-revamp|wireframe|revamp'\",\"query\":\"ui-revamp-plan|ui-ux-revamp|wireframe|revamp\",\"path\":null}],\"source\":\"unified_exe